sequenceDiagram
    title Quản lý sản phẩm và biến thể
    actor Employee
    participant AdminPortal
    participant API
    participant ProductService
    participant VariantService
    participant PostgreSQL

    Employee->>AdminPortal: Tạo sản phẩm
    AdminPortal->>API: POST /products
    API->>ProductService: Validate category and product
    ProductService->>PostgreSQL: INSERT product
    PostgreSQL-->>ProductService: Product record
    API-->>AdminPortal: 201 product
    Employee->>AdminPortal: Thêm biến thể
    AdminPortal->>API: POST /products/:productId/variants
    API->>VariantService: Validate price size color
    VariantService->>PostgreSQL: INSERT product variant
    PostgreSQL-->>VariantService: Variant record
    API-->>AdminPortal: 201 variant
    Employee->>AdminPortal: Cập nhật hoặc xóa
    AdminPortal->>API: PATCH or DELETE product or variant
    API->>ProductService: Check references and update
    ProductService->>PostgreSQL: UPDATE or DELETE records
    PostgreSQL-->>ProductService: Result
    API-->>AdminPortal: 200 updated or 204 deleted
